  "description": "Erection of full-width rear single-storey extension and half width rear two-storey extension with metal framed glazed doors, timber framed sash windows, rooflights, flat sedum and pitched natural slate roof finishes; single-storey full width side extension with roof glazing and pitched natural slate roof, metal framed glazed door to rear and new solid timber entrance door to front. Installation of external wall insulation (EWI) with render finish to full height of flank elevation, lower ground floor level to front elevation and upper ground floor level to rear elevation with associated coursing and mouldings. Replacement of existing 2 no. front velux rooflights with flush conservation rooflights; insertion of single new flush conservation rooflight to rear roof slope. Replacement of existing front and rear dormers with larger dormers with lead finish. Replacement of selected timber sash and casement windows with new timber framed sash windows with vacuum glass. New window opening to rear elevation with timber sash window with vacuum glass. Replacement of upvc drainage goods with cast metal drainage goods. New timber bin and bike stores to front garden and alteration to tree planters; new york stone front steps. Fell Lawson Cypress and Gingko trees to rear; replacement trees.\n \n\n\n",
